      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mitchell Douglas are pleased to present this charming extended 3 bedroomed\r\nhome directly opposite The People's Park.\r\nSituated in a highly sought-after, mature residential area, this home lets you\r\nstep directly out your front door for morning walks in the park.\r\nWith local amenities, town centre conveniences, and public transport all accessible on foot\r\noffers an easy, low commute lifestyle.\r\nThe accommodation comprises of a livingroom, diningroom, kitchen and bathroom.\r\nUpstairs there are 3 bedrooms.\r\nIdeal for first-time buyers seeking an affordable route to a prime address, creative homeowners\r\nlooking for a project as the property is in need of refurbishment."
